@jidekaixin2dian/dsh-file-actions README · 文件与链接操作 · File Actions：**代码引用连同来源一起带走，交付文件右键就能接着用。**

[English](README.en.md) · [npm · 0.1.20](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@jidekaixin2dian/dsh-file-actions/v/0.1.20) · [插件市场](https://awesome-dsh-plugin.com/p/jidekaixin2dian/dsh-file-actions/) · [下载](https://github.com/jidekaixin2dian/dsh-file-actions/releases/latest) · [更新记录](CHANGELOG.md)

File Actions 为 DeepSeek Harness（DSH）里的文件引用提供右键菜单。从代码行号、交付卡片或图片进入，直接查看上下文、选择应用、预览、定位和复制。

@jidekaixin2dian/dsh-file-actions README · 使用边界：**找不到「打开方式」？** 查询为空或失败时会隐藏关联行，下次右键重试。系统损坏的应用关联需要在系统或宿主侧处理。

**预览没有打开？** 检查浏览器是否拦截了弹窗。

</details>

@jidekaixin2dian/dsh-file-actions README · Install and update：Requires **DSH >=0.2.1-rc.2 and Node >=24**. CI verifies DSH rc.2 / rc.3 / rc.4 / rc.5 / 0.2.2-alpha.3 / 0.2.2-rc.1.

Search for **dsh-file-actions** in the marketplace and verify author **jidekaixin2dian**. Existing users can check updates under installed plugins. Catalog and registry mirrors may take time to refresh.

